WEBVTT

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:09.320
That's Princess Veronica's personal vehicle, the Magiship <i>Sylvanus</i>.

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.870
Princess Veronica has come into view!

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:25.500
So that's...

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.280
Veronica Lautreamont, First Princess.

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:17.690
You show your loyalty
by coming to greet me.

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:19.450
Is Silvia here?

00:02:19.810 --> 00:02:20.590
Yes.

00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:27.600
It's been a while, sister.

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:30.210
Four years, two months,
and thirteen days.

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:33.360
Indeed. I see you're well.

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:35.460
How I've looked forward to this day.

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:37.420
Do you mean to deceive me?

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:51.600
That's the Veronica I know.
There's no fooling <i>you</i>.

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:58.480
Cosette!

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:02.490
Out with it. Where is the real Silvia?

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.940
H-Here I am!

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:14.160
It's been too long.

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:17.000
Sister...

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:22.640
What is it, little sister?

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:25.130
Weak in the knees, I see.

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:27.400
N-No, I-

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:29.640
You've displayed such great ineptitude.

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:33.180
And you count yourself part of the House of Lautreamont?

00:03:33.990 --> 00:03:35.900
You disappoint me.

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:43.280
Time for your punishment, Silvia.

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:09.540
It seems only your breasts and your behind have grown.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:13.230
Will you be this ashamed
on the battlefield?

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:15.340
That's you in a nutshell.

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:18.380
You act pretentious, but really, you're nothing but a little girl.

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:20.360
Never mind your Dragonar ambition.

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:24.280
It's far more appropriate
for you to settle down!

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:25.800
Now just a moment!

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:29.070
You've humiliated your
own family in public.

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:30.910
Is that any way for
knight royalty to act?!

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:33.880
Ash!

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:37.680
He is merely a student, Glen.

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:39.170
Hey, hold it!

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:40.040
Don't talk to my dog like-

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:44.970
Ah, I see. So you're Ash Blake.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:46.970
That simplifies things.

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:49.260
Glen, seize him.

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:50.240
As you wish.

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:53.060
Wh-What's the big idea?!

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:56.560
Dammit! Put me down! Why, you...

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:05.570
<i>The Tantalos clan was in the midst of a horrible ethnic conflict.</i>

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:08.890
<i>Because Master Milgauss put a stop to it,</i>

00:05:08.890 --> 00:05:11.620
<i>we can live the way we do today.</i>

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:13.600
<i>And that's why I'd do anything...</i>

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:15.710
Shamara! This is real bad!

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:17.770
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:20.700
I'm Anya now, head of the Tantalos!

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:22.570
Don't use my old name ever again!

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:25.420
I-I'm sorry, Anya... ma'am.

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:27.440
So what is it?

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:28.760
Well, uh...

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:35.180
The Iron Blood Valkyrie
has come to Ansullivan!

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:39.060
Once word got out,
everyone headed into town,

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:40.820
bent on avenging their friends!

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:43.020
<i>Rushing into the fray
with no battle plan?</i>

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:44.820
<i>I've got to stop them.</i>

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:46.820
My goodness!

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:48.740
That suits you just perfectly!

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:50.910
U-Um...

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:52.990
Why am I dressed like this again?

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:56.640
I have been charged with providing you guidance, Master Ash.

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:58.970
My name is Primrose Shelley,

00:05:58.970 --> 00:06:02.250
but please, if you would,
just call me Prim!

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:03.930
O-Okay.

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:06.440
But what exactly is going on here?

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:08.330
Princess Veronica's orders.

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:11.020
"Just a little diversion," she said.

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:12.140
D-Diversion?

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:14.400
Now, off we go, Master Ash!

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:16.100
There's much work to be done!

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:17.890
Wai- Prim, not that way!

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:19.020
Huh?

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:25.030
<i>I-Is she okay?</i>

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:32.010
I'm beat.

00:06:32.010 --> 00:06:35.450
And despite all that, Prim still handles her servant duties.

00:06:40.550 --> 00:06:42.540
"The Heavenly Dragonar"?

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:45.630
So this is where the
Silver Knight thing started.

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:55.170
Will you be this ashamed
on the battlefield?

00:07:11.390 --> 00:07:12.400
Oh my!

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:14.090
P-Prim?!

00:07:14.090 --> 00:07:15.720
I-I'm so sorry for kneading-

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:17.320
I mean, for reading this
book without asking!

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:18.880
I just... I'm sorry!

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:23.250
The Silver Knight is just the coolest!

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:27.180
Especially when he used ice magic to freeze that mechanized dragon

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:29.550
and bring it to a standstill!

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:32.680
A frozen dragon?

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:34.760
Oh, that's right!

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:38.020
The princess has returned,
and she's asking for you.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:38.680
Huh?

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:52.680
There's no time to be shy!

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:54.410
You must undress right away.

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.800
For goodness' sake, spare me!

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:58.380
Why do I have to?

00:07:58.380 --> 00:07:59.660
This is the undressing room.

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:01.910
It's simply a place where you undress!

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:03.690
Come on, Master Ash!

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:04.920
That's not what I was asking!

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:07.290
Princess Veronica is waiting!

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:11.130
Fine, then I'll just strip you buck naked with my undressing technique!

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:11.920
Here I go!

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:16.030
P-Prim?!

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:17.530
I messed up!

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.730
Geez! You stay out of it, Prim!

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:21.890
Excuse me!

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:23.260
Now, Master Ash,

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:25.580
by our princess's orders...

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:28.190
W-Wait!

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:30.120
I'm not mentally or
physically prepared yet!

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:31.880
This is non-negotiable.

00:08:33.270 --> 00:08:35.340
We should go, Professor Angela.

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:39.700
Right. This is a rare opportunity to take a bath on the <i>Sylvanus</i>.

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:41.450
S-Stop it!

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:52.110
You two were affected by
the Necromancia's attack.

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:54.340
What's your take on it?

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:58.350
It seems to me the
perpetrator has Imperial ties.

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:03.980
A Necromancia is a product of a field of study that combines magic and engineering.

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:07.360
Engineering? That's Zepharos's forte.

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:10.320
But without any definite proof...

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:11.360
Um...

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:14.570
Why am I here in the bath with you?

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:15.850
What's wrong?

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:19.000
Does bathing with us
displease you in some way?

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.860
I-It's not that.

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:22.990
This bath smells great.

00:09:22.990 --> 00:09:24.830
Kinda makes me feel all soft an' fluffy...

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:28.250
I thought I'd try anthar-scented
bath salts today.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.210
Eco!

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:35.050
Who would think that
a couple of novices like you

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:37.800
are the heroes who
defeated the Necromancia?

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:42.960
So this is the young dragon Eco, who threw
together Arch from whatever she could find.

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:46.430
And Ash Blake, who can
ride any dragon around.

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:48.110
Princess?

00:09:48.110 --> 00:09:51.240
Her Highness the Fourth
Princess is here to see you.

00:09:52.370 --> 00:09:55.320
Begging your pardon... Sister.

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:57.180
P-Princess?!

00:09:57.180 --> 00:09:59.580
A-Ash?! And Rebecca?!

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:01.450
Oh, Master Ash!
Fancy seeing you here.

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:03.870
Is that you, Cosette?

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:06.290
Hi, Sis!

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:08.670
Sis?

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:17.150
As it happens, Silvia,

00:10:17.150 --> 00:10:19.510
I come bearing a marriage proposal.

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:23.420
Ever since the rightful heir,
our brother Julius,

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:26.050
was executed for the
crime of dragon-killing,

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:30.770
the future of our royal line
has remained uncertain.

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:33.020
You're already sixteen.

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:36.400
Bear a healthy child now,
while you're still young.

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:39.130
We can’t let our bloodline
end here, now can we?

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:40.110
B-But...

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:43.850
Aren't you the first princess, Veronica?

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:46.810
The only affairs that interest me are military.

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:50.330
Honestly. If only Julius were still here,

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:52.500
instead of losing his life to a foolish trifle.

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:56.330
I-I'm sure our brother had his reasons.

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:57.340
The way you talk...

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:01.500
You always did have a soft spot for Julius.

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:03.020
Good news, then.

00:11:03.020 --> 00:11:06.040
Your marriage prospect is a friend of his.

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:07.600
You don't mean...

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:12.060
That's right. One of
my knights, Glen McGuire.

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:15.230
You were equally attached to
them both, once upon a time.

00:11:15.560 --> 00:11:16.760
I'm sure you'll be satisfied.

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:23.200
B-But my dream is to become
an Archdragonar with Lancelot.

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:26.740
If I get married a-and have
children before that happens...

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:30.600
Considering your poor showing during this last attack,

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:32.630
that's an awfully daring ambition.

00:11:34.020 --> 00:11:35.480
It wasn't like that at all!

00:11:35.480 --> 00:11:41.180
If she hadn't sent Lancelot, I could
never have ridden the Necromancia!

00:11:42.150 --> 00:11:46.720
In other words, Silvia served as little more than a courier.

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:47.890
No!

00:11:48.230 --> 00:11:50.800
It only matters if she gets results.

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:52.000
Silvia.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:54.610
With your dreams and ambitions, you're all talk and no action.

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:57.480
Are you kidding me?

00:11:57.980 --> 00:12:01.290
The princess can be honest
to a fault sometimes,

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:04.160
but she <i>always</i> does
the absolute best she can!

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:07.470
You haven't even seen
what she's capable of!

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:16.080
Well, then...

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:22.810
As it happens, there will be
a match in my honor tomorrow.

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:26.300
Prove to me the value of your little dream.

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:34.020
I will.

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:56.420
Geez, I wanted to play too!

00:12:56.740 --> 00:13:01.260
You mean you want to be out there with those dragons?

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:05.680
Why did I have to be born
looking like this, anyway?

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:08.430
Dragons are an extremely
intelligent species.

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:13.930
There must be a reason
you were given human form.

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:16.620
You'll understand someday.

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:51.430
A-Amazing!

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:04.380
Princess!

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:05.820
Hey!

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:28.640
My room?

00:14:28.640 --> 00:14:30.360
Are you all right, Princess?

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:36.480
Wh-What are you doing here?

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:40.810
Master Ash carried you here.

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:42.990
H-He did?

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:46.410
I was worried about you.

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:48.560
Lancelot's a great dragon,

00:14:48.560 --> 00:14:54.380
but even he can't take a head-on collision
with the Academy's toughest, Cu Chulainn.

00:14:55.860 --> 00:14:57.830
I had to show her.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:03.450
To show my sister how
I fight as a real life Dragonar.

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:07.090
But now I'm a failure
even as Lancelot's master.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:10.220
Don't beat yourself up about it.

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:14.850
Silence! I <i>knew </i>Lancelot
should have been his...

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:16.880
Silvia, it's me.

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:19.230
Rebecca? C-Come in.

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:23.520
Pardon me. I need to speak with Ash.

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:26.270
Also, I've brought a guest.

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:35.900
I've come to inquire about
your condition, Princess Silvia.

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:38.370
I see. Apologies for the trouble.

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:41.120
Not at all. I'm here on
Princess Veronica's orders.

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:46.060
As you can see,
it's nothing serious.

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:47.660
I understand.

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:51.420
I also bring a message
from Princess Veronica.

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:52.630
What is it?

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:57.840
The princess will be touring
the town at noon tomorrow.

00:15:57.840 --> 00:15:58.640
At that time...

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:04.400
I know. Don't make a scene
as her escort, right?

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:08.820
No. It will not be necessary
for you to accompany her.

00:16:09.240 --> 00:16:10.040
What?

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:12.970
She commands you to
visit St. Valeria tomorrow,

00:16:12.970 --> 00:16:16.170
where you are to offer
prayers of repentance.

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:17.950
Repentance?!

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:23.500
The princess is quite angry
over your lack of ability.

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:29.320
Your simple tactics mistake
recklessness for bravery,

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:31.710
revealing how shallow your dream really is.

00:16:31.710 --> 00:16:35.400
And when you go to pray,
take no servants with you.

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:36.890
You must do your soul-searching alone.

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:38.920
So says the princess.

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:42.420
If you will excuse me.

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:46.020
Wait, Glen.

00:16:47.070 --> 00:16:51.950
Did my sister tell you about
the marriage proposal?

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:53.050
Yes.

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:58.030
Would you really be willing
to take me as your wife?

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:01.040
If Princess Veronica commands it.

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:03.060
I see.

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:05.310
That's all. Dismissed.

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:09.540
Hey, what's with the attitude?

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:10.680
Ash!

00:17:10.680 --> 00:17:13.180
Getting married is
a lifelong commitment,

00:17:13.180 --> 00:17:15.300
and you'll do it at a single command?

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:17.680
My mistress's word is law.

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:20.810
And if she told you to
drop dead, would you,

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:22.020
no questions asked?

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:24.020
Of course.

00:17:24.340 --> 00:17:28.650
You're a puppet. Have you
no will of your own?!

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:30.920
Ash Blake, was it?

00:17:31.350 --> 00:17:34.700
Perhaps you are riding high
after saving the town.

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:37.660
I applaud your luck and skill. However...

00:17:38.680 --> 00:17:40.160
Remember your place.

00:17:42.050 --> 00:17:45.200
Geez! What's with that
coldhearted creep?!

00:17:45.200 --> 00:17:48.290
He wasn't always like that.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:51.040
But ten years ago,

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:54.320
when my brother was
executed for dragon-killing,

00:17:54.320 --> 00:17:57.050
he grew despondent and
became a different person.

00:17:57.990 --> 00:18:01.310
My sister proved to be his salvation.

00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:07.190
She is of high enough caliber to manage a knight like Glen.

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:09.310
Princess...

00:18:10.390 --> 00:18:12.750
Ash, I've got a message for you.

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:16.670
The Student Council is meeting tomorrow morning to discuss the royal tour.

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:17.700
Don't be late.

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:20.010
B-But what about me?

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:24.380
We can't give you Student Council work when you're like this.

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:25.120
But-

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:29.120
If you don't like it, you'll have to surpass Princess Veronica.

00:18:30.070 --> 00:18:33.880
S-Surpass my sister?

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:38.840
Excuse me!

00:18:43.590 --> 00:18:46.480
Eco? Wh-What's going on?

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:48.980
Geez, you're late!

00:18:50.680 --> 00:18:51.980
This is too much.

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:54.980
My body's so hot. I can't take it.

00:18:59.090 --> 00:19:00.740
Is that <i>anthar</i> I smell?!

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:03.390
Hang on. What have you got in there?

00:19:03.390 --> 00:19:05.240
In there?

00:19:05.780 --> 00:19:08.000
You mean... in here?

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:11.120
No! Not your skirt! Your <i>mouth</i>!

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:16.730
Candy? So that's the culprit. Spit it out!

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:24.950
Did you just...

00:19:26.440 --> 00:19:30.140
A rather unhealthy relationship
you have there, no?

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:33.020
Though it made for a pretty good show.

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:37.600
Those <i>are</i> my undergarments she's wearing.

00:19:37.600 --> 00:19:40.560
And did you give her this candy?

00:19:40.560 --> 00:19:43.690
She gets that pleading look in her eyes. l just can't say no.

00:19:43.690 --> 00:19:45.770
Now come on in.

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:47.540
Rebecca...

00:19:48.520 --> 00:19:51.790
Our vice president and
secretary are absent today.

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:54.220
It's a little lonely here with just us three,

00:19:54.220 --> 00:19:55.790
but let's get this meeting underway.

00:19:56.420 --> 00:20:01.680
We will be accompanying Princess Veronica on her tour through town.

00:20:02.020 --> 00:20:06.560
However, intel indicates that this individual may have infiltrated Ansullivan.

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:10.930
Five years ago, this former mountain guerrilla terrorist...

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:14.030
attempted to assassinate Princess Veronica.

00:20:14.030 --> 00:20:15.940
She's been undercover ever since.

00:20:17.680 --> 00:20:19.420
Avdocha, She Who Condemns.

00:20:26.520 --> 00:20:28.720
Oh, Princess Veronica!

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:31.410
How nice of you to come all this way!

00:20:32.050 --> 00:20:34.970
Do not slow your hand! Keep working!

00:20:34.970 --> 00:20:36.280
Yes, Your Highness!

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:41.760
<i>Any one of them could be a terrorist.</i>

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:44.720
Your nerves are showing, Ash.

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:45.280
But...

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:49.890
My favorite crepe shop...

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:53.820
Hey, Eco, I might wind up
needing that Arch again, okay?

00:20:53.820 --> 00:20:57.870
Hmph! You can have that
patchwork pile of parts.

00:20:57.870 --> 00:21:00.560
But in return, as soon as
that place is rebuilt...

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:04.190
Yeah, sure. I'll buy you as
many crepes as you want.

00:21:04.190 --> 00:21:06.280
You will? Deal!

00:21:10.280 --> 00:21:12.790
I hope the princess is okay.

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:20.290
O St. Valeria...

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:23.760
I pray before you with purest heart,

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:26.440
in punishment for my own arrogance.

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:29.740
Forgive me my imprudent behavior.

00:21:29.740 --> 00:21:31.810
O St. Valeria...

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:36.330
May the Silver Knight impregnate me!

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:39.910
What kind of prayer is <i>that</i>,
Jessica Valentine?!

00:21:40.790 --> 00:21:42.940
Oh, Princess Silvia.

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:44.590
What do you mean, "Oh"?

00:21:44.590 --> 00:21:48.570
How dare you talk about... g-getting impregnated in such a holy place!

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:50.510
Whatever do you mean?

00:21:50.510 --> 00:21:52.280
I'm simply praying for
a wholesome pregnancy!

00:21:52.280 --> 00:21:54.380
St. Valeria is the patron of the law!

00:21:54.380 --> 00:21:56.580
You're praying to the wrong saint!

00:21:57.460 --> 00:22:01.400
We nobles don't concern
ourselves with such trivialities.

00:22:01.400 --> 00:22:03.770
Surely our dear saint
is generous of heart.

00:22:03.770 --> 00:22:06.270
What a convenient excuse.

00:22:06.270 --> 00:22:09.360
With nobility comes great capacity.

00:22:09.360 --> 00:22:12.510
Why, that's true of Princess Veronica, is it not?

00:22:12.510 --> 00:22:13.640
What?

00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:20.020
Though I suppose a fourth princess wouldn't be nearly as capable as her older sister.

00:22:20.280 --> 00:22:22.020
Now listen here, you!

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:39.170
St. Valeria once said,
"Hate the sin, but love the sinner."

00:22:39.830 --> 00:22:41.260
What imbecility!

00:22:41.260 --> 00:22:44.840
Indeed, the foolish heart is
the very root of all evil!

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:46.800
Death to all sinners!

00:22:48.360 --> 00:22:52.240
I am Avdocha, She Who Condemns!

00:24:30.750 --> 00:24:33.860
I hear you're a complete pervert, Ash Blake.

00:24:33.860 --> 00:24:35.530
There's some real misinformation going around!

00:24:35.530 --> 00:24:37.990
And that you really love it when a haughty woman berates you.

00:24:37.990 --> 00:24:39.830
So it keeps getting better!

00:24:39.830 --> 00:24:43.260
I'll vilify you until you wish you'd never been born.

00:24:43.260 --> 00:24:45.040
I'll pass on that!
